    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Abyssal Descent</i> is a brutal 2D platformer about falling\u2014fast, deep, and without forgiveness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend through <strong>80 handcrafted pixel-art levels</strong>, each more surreal and punishing than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>no saves</strong>, <strong>no checkpoints</strong>, and <strong>no second chances</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn from your mistakes, dodge deadly traps, and try to survive the abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you reach the bottom without breaking?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Abyssal Descent</i> is a brutal 2D platformer about falling\u2014fast, deep, and without forgiveness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend through <strong>80 handcrafted pixel-art levels</strong>, each more surreal and punishing than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>no saves</strong>, <strong>no checkpoints</strong>, and <strong>no second chances</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn from your mistakes, dodge deadly traps, and try to survive the abyss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you reach the bottom without breaking?</p>",
